-- TESTING -------------------------------------------------------------------
  Tested      Played by the owner in JNext 2026-11-06: approved. Differential
              replays, figure and edge tests, deliberately broken builds,
              JNext pace and AY checks, and the real loader (default,
              Enhanced, all eight cheats) on disposable card copies.

  Replay      All registers including R, working RAM and sprite pixels
              compared against the original drawing routines: 23,816 replay
              frames over menus, play, death, game over and restart, 59 room-
              start fixtures; 13 deliberately broken builds detected.

  Emulator    JNext 1.1.104; four incoming speed values and both IFF states;
              exact ordered AY stream after accounting for startup phase;
              direct/NEXLOAD boot checked.

  Hardware    none

  Nothing here claims a result on real hardware unless the line above says so.

-- HOW TO USE ----------------------------------------------------------------
  Put this .nxc and the game file in the same folder on the Next's card and
  choose the .nxc in the Browser. See README.txt.
